 {'id':'getting-started','title':'Getting started & workspace setup','category':'Getting Started & Onboarding','body':'Complete the 5-step guided setup: Your Business, Business Profile, Ideal Customers, Research Setup, and Plan & Payment. You can create multiple independent workspaces—each workspace keeps its own profile, integrations, discoveries, and subscription.','href':'/onboarding'},
 {'id':'discover-conversations','title':'Discovering conversations & saved searches','category':'Discovering Conversations','body':'Run AI-assisted or Advanced Filter discoveries across permitted public sources (GitHub, Hacker News, Stack Exchange, Bluesky, YouTube, Discourse, and Atom feeds). Save recurring queries under Saved Searches and review past runs in Discovery History.','href':'/intent-radar/discover'},
 {'id':'signals-opportunities','title':'Reviewing intent signals & opportunities','category':'Intent Signals & Opportunities','body':'Inspect original public evidence, relevance explanations, and AI assessments on every signal. Qualify promising discussions into Opportunities to track priority, notes, and next actions. Relevance scores are analytical signals, not verified buying guarantees.','href':'/intent-radar/signals'},
 {'id':'monitors-alerts','title':'Monitors, schedules & alert notifications','category':'Monitoring & Alerts','body':'Turn high-value queries into Active Monitors that check sources on a daily or configured schedule. Manage in-app notifications, email alerts, quiet hours, and alert sensitivity in Settings → Research Preferences → Notifications & Alerts.','href':'/intent-radar/monitors'},
 {'id':'ai-assistant-icps','title':'AI Assistant & Ideal Customer Profiles','category':'AI Assistant & Ideal Customers','body':'Define one or more Ideal Customer Profiles (industries, roles, pain points, buying signals) to guide discovery ranking. Use the PlaneByte AI Assistant to query your authorized workspace data, analyze signals, and review proposed actions before execution.','href':'/intent-radar/ideal-customers'},
 {'id':'sources-integrations','title':'Research sources, GitHub & custom feeds','category':'Research Sources & Integrations','body':'Connect your GitHub App for repository and webhook monitoring, configure Stack Exchange sites, and enable curated or custom Atom/Discourse feeds. Source AI policies (Authorized vs Restricted) are strictly enforced—for example, YouTube metadata is display-only and never sent to AI models.','href':'/settings?category=integrations&tab=sources'},
 {'id':'developer-api-mcp','title':'Developer API & MCP server setup','category':'Developer API & MCP','body':'Workspace owners and administrators can issue scoped API keys for the read-only REST API and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server at /api/v1/mcp. Every request verifies active workspace membership, entitlements, and rate limits; revoking a key takes effect immediately.','href':'/settings?category=integrations&tab=developer'},
 {'id':'billing-subscriptions','title':'Billing, Starter Trial & subscriptions','category':'Billing, Trials & Subscriptions','body':'Intent Radar plans include Starter ($59/mo), Growth ($149/mo), Scale ($379/mo), and custom Enterprise agreements in tax-inclusive USD billed via Creem. Eligible accounts receive a 3-day Starter Trial. Manage payment methods, invoices, plan switches, or cancellation anytime in Settings → Billing & Usage.','href':'/settings?category=billing&tab=overview'},
 {'id':'team-workspaces-security','title':'Team roles, workspaces, domains & audit logs','category':'Team, Workspaces & Security','body':'Invite teammates by company email with Owner, Admin, Member, or Viewer permissions. Verify company domains via DNS TXT records, review workspace activity in the filterable Audit Log, and switch cleanly between isolated workspaces from the header switcher.','href':'/settings?category=team&tab=members'},
 {'id':'troubleshooting','title':'Troubleshooting & common issues','category':'Troubleshooting & Known Issues','body':'Resolve workspace access restrictions (complete onboarding or activate a plan), monthly vs daily usage limits, DNS propagation delays, or missing source integrations. Use Contact Support to report a bug with optional safe diagnostic metadata.','href':'/help'},
